      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "poison"
      ],
      "text": "20 feet. After Athervox uses her Poison Breath, a cloud of poison gas continues to emanate from her body for 1 round. Any creature that ends their turn in the miasma takes 4d6 poison damage (DC 39 basic Fortitude save save). Any creature in the miasma is Concealed and treats other creatures as concealed. Athervox can see through this concealment.\n\nEffect: Miasma",
