    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Impaling Charge",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements Athervox doesn't have a creature impaled on her horn\n\n---\nEffect Athervox attempts to gore a foe. She Strides, then attempts a horn Strike. On a hit, the target becomes impaled on Athervox's horn. The creature is Grabbed while on the horn (and can Escape as normal). Athervox doesn't need to use additional actions to keep the impaled creature grabbed. If Athervox moves, she brings the grabbed creature along with her."
    },
